commit 5482eddcea0221b00b04a22e66897a23cab0b896

C03: reading a capture confirmed in the same mission is covered by that consent (SCREEN1405)

SCREEN1403 measured «leéme lo que dice la pantalla»: the root approved the capture, it completed and verified, and the mission then asked a second confirmation for ocr.read, which is privacy-sensitive as well; the reviewed turn hosts one confirmation, so no read ran. The person asked to read the screen and confirmed the capture; asking again to read that same capture is not a new privacy decision.

MissionEngine: a capture.screenshot or capture.active.window that completed and verified under a granted confirmation records its captureId for its mission; an ocr.read or vision.describe whose captureId is that capture, in that same mission, is allowed without a new challenge. Any other capture, mission or operation keeps the confirmation.

Kernel recompiled (BUILD1405). Tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


